<td data-local-id=3D"79d9831d0e92" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0490d8aa87d">All five OPC Go utility services use Cloud9=E2=
=80=99s Go 1.25.6 FIPS image, which integrates Cisco CSM Go-FIPS tooling an=
d FOM 7.3a. FOM 7.3a is covered by NIST FIPS 140-3 Certificate #4747, valid=
 through July 31, 2029.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4e9a73e8ce6a">The remaining gap is Grafana=E2=80=99s Python-=
based synthetic-monitoring builds, which use OpenSSL 3.5.7. These must be c=
onfigured and validated for FIPS 140-3 compliance using Cloud9=E2=80=99s <c=
ode>hardened_alpine:3.24-fips</code> base image.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a903168e27b6"><strong>&lt;Already 140-3 compliant - need evi=
dence &gt;</strong><br><br>
CBOM in <span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"UM=
BISE-5180"> <a href=3D"https://cisco-sbg.atlassian.net/browse/UMBISE-5180" =
