nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fde1ffe82931">Completed (September 10, 2026)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f01a7af3-4732-4e1d-9fe6-f1c4f2af215c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e608d72c0e8e">9/30/2026 <em>(Hard-blocked on upstream packag=
e </em><a href=3D"https://cisco-sbg.atlassian.net/browse/DPT-4989" class=3D=
"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow"><em>DPT-4989</em></a><em>)</em> | On Septe=
mber 9th they commented that this could not be done until <time datetime=3D=
"2026-09-30" class=3D"date-future">30 Sep 2026</time> The team is aiming to=
 complete this upgrade same day, but if something does not work more time m=
ay be needed.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"408ddfc9-96a2-447f-8903-b0fd68dd129a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f7601cee4393"><time datetime=3D"2026-10-05" class=3D"date-fu=
ture">05 Oct 2026</time><br>
T<em>argeted 9/25/2026, but staging deployment cannot occur until container=
 images are rebuilt with the new package. Because upstream </em><a href=3D"=
https://cisco-sbg.atlassian.net/browse/DPT-4989" class=3D"external-link" re=
l=3D"nofollow"><em>DPT-4989</em></a><em> delivers on 9/30, Stage rollout an=
d non-production runtime FIPS verification are scheduled for the first week=
 of October (<strong>10/05/2026</strong>).</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e69c6d7c-2af7-4dc8-a9ae-f142e2359a6c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ddb90475a8d">Yes, runtime FIPS validation checks exist</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"382aa131-2832-4fa7-9ca7-670d5c79a4fc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8106d00980ff"><time datetime=3D"2026-10-13" class=3D"date-fu=
ture">13 Oct 2026</time></p>
<p local-id=3D"cd3305de3a0d"><em>Production rollout requires successful sta=
ging qualification and standard SRE deployment lead time (~1 week). Followi=
ng Stage sign-off on 10/05, the IL2 production deployment package will be h=
anded over and executed with SRE on <strong>10/13/2026</strong>. (Dashweb P=
rod Fed deployment is tuesdays)</em></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"929fb4e4-59a7-4825-befd-7b39a560915d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e1dba3428edb"><time datetime=3D"2026-10-20" class=3D"date-fu=
ture">20 Oct 2026</time></p>
<p local-id=3D"c7b1b382da34"><em>Targeted 9/25/2026, but IL5 deployment fol=
lows IL2 production stabilization and requires Teleport-gated deployment pi=
pelines. With upstream delivery on 9/30 and IL2 rollout on 10/12, IL5 produ=
ction deployment is scheduled for <strong>10/20/2026</strong>.</em></p></td=
>
