<td data-local-id=3D"f413f9090e7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94c1f9d0756d">Will be done on Hashicorp 140-3 fips Enterpris=
e compliance image</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c32122769953" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a64eab9e81e">Yes</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c37f5723678e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d981ebeff42"><time datetime=3D"2026-09-03" class=3D"date-pa=
st">03 Sep 2026</time></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"635241024205" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"02fd592b1439">Waiting on Hashicorp 140-3 compliance Enterpri=
se image</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"03a6c36c35e8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f880c5cd7a75"><time datetime=3D"2026-10-02" class=3D"date-fu=
ture">02 Oct 2026</time></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d6a4484c83d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3deaa2cf3be9">Completed</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b0a7dd55927f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"660b4ab8763f"><time datetime=3D"2026-10-11" class=3D"date-fu=
ture">11 Oct 2026</time></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ebc3cd6a7636" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a8ecceadaf28"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fbe35ca3f342" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ac8b453d82e"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"88f27f0db9e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dcfa30b170e1">We have done the analysis based on the analysi=
s we mainly need to move from boringcrypto and base OS upgrade which is 140=
-2 FIPS compliance to gofips 140-3 FIPs compliance binary for multiple imag=
es for Consul and its dependent images</p>
<p local-id=3D"65d04213436a"></p>
<p local-id=3D"9982644fb4c6">Internally we discussed and came up with 2 app=
roaches which can deal with 140-3 compliance requirements</p>
<p local-id=3D"75d4f1d5a747">Approach 1: Enterprise image we will be gettin=
g it by 15th sep and requires 2 weeks on test + prod deployment time</p>
<p local-id=3D"77277a34c6c2">We are in process of reaching out to cloud org=
 for the process of change to the enterprise binary</p>
<p local-id=3D"a0cdd15925f2"></p>
<p local-id=3D"5b27078f389c">Approach 2: Self build images, we will be buil=
ding our images required based on 140-3 FIPs compliance and will need 2 and=
 half week of effort to upgrade and test + prod deployment&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"42e3531f66e2">Deployment need to be coordinated which will r=
equire upstream and downstream team to be available for the deployment proc=
ess</p></td>
</tr>
