<p local-id=3D"f5ec013f0357"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e99f3917d67d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"48988b01ae3b">The runtime image identifies itself as Chaingu=
ard VERSION_ID=3D20230214 (ID=3Dchainguard). The SCIM binary uses the nativ=
e Geomys Go FIPS module, reported with CMVP #5247 and kernel-independent en=
tropy source #E318. The image also contains the Chainguard OpenSSL FIPS pro=
vider 3.4.0, reported with CMVP #5132 and entropy source #E191. Together wi=
th GODEBUG=3Dfips140=3Don and the passed self-tests, this provides FIPS 140=
-3 module and runtime evidence;</p></td>
</tr>
