st">03 Aug 2026</time></p>
<p local-id=3D"d2529400c2f5">ADC consumes cryptographic services exclusivel=
y through the host operating system's runtime cryptographic libraries (Micr=
osoft Cryptographic Next Generation / CNG). ADC does not include, package, =
or distribute any FIPS-validated cryptographic module binaries within the a=
pplication. Furthermore, ADC does not provision or manage the operating sys=
tem; the FIPS 140 validated modules, FIPS mode configuration, and OS servic=
ing are owned and maintained by the underlying Windows platform.. Details c=
an be found here: <a href=3D"https://cisco-sbg.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PR=
OD/pages/1504973378/AD+Connector+Cryptography+Inventory" data-linked-resour=
ce-id=3D"1504973378" data-linked-resource-version=3D"15" data-linked-resour=
ce-type=3D"page">AD Connector FIPS 140-3 - Products - Confluence</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"15f631d0d219"></p>
<p local-id=3D"f6ac90ac4f49"><time datetime=3D"2026-09-03" class=3D"date-pa=
