<td data-local-id=3D"026dec24058d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ccfdebf232da">On track<br>
image has no <code>/bin/sh</code>, causing the toolkit=E2=80=99s default FI=
PS check to produce a false negative. image SBOM contains <code>bc-fips</co=
de> 2.1.3 while CMVP #4943 documentation references validated software vers=
ion 2.1.1; OpenSSL provider package is <code>3.4.0-r5</code>, which require=
s confirmation against CMVP #5132 scope. Verify the stated OpenSSL API vers=
ion <code>3.6.3</code> against the SBOM package version <code>libcrypto3 3.=
6.4-r1</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
