<p local-id=3D"0cde4bca3d56"><em>The team list comes from the org's FedRAMP=
 roster as of 10-Aug-2026. Fill in your own owner where the row says TBD.</=
em></p>
<p local-id=3D"22a47c396aea"><strong>Blocked On examples:</strong> waiting =
on platform guidance =C2=B7 need confirmation of inherited path =C2=B7 need=
 vendor evidence =C2=B7 need infrastructure change =C2=B7 need production-l=
ike test support</p>
<p local-id=3D"83f3714f3f26"><strong>Comments examples:</strong> using inhe=
rited AWS path =C2=B7 runtime configured, verification in progress =C2=B7 b=
ackend TLS change pending =C2=B7 open question on runtime crypto</p>
